# Title: Python Spawning Pretty TTY on Windows
# ID: 480e7e51-e797-47e3-8d72-ebfce65b6d8d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nextron Systems
# Date: 2022-06-03
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
# Description: Detects python spawning a pretty tty
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process_name:*python.exe OR process_name:*python3.exe OR process_name:*python2.exe)) AND (((cmdline:*import pty* AND cmdline:*.spawn(*)) OR (cmdline:*from pty import spawn*)))
